<view class="page index-page">
  <view class="top-safe"></view>

  <view class="hero card">
    <image class="hero-bg" src="{{assets.hero.background}}" mode="aspectFit"></image>
    <view class="brand-row">
      <image class="brand-logo" src="{{assets.brand.logo}}" mode="widthFix"></image>
    </view>

    <view class="hero-copy">
      <text class="hero-kicker">GEO INTELLIGENCE FOR BRANDS</text>
      <text class="hero-title">让品牌在 AI 时代
被看见、被理解、被选择</text>
      <text class="hero-lead">199元获取一次品牌 GEO诊断</text>

      <view class="hero-actions">
        <button class="primary-button hero-primary" bindtap="goDiagnosis">
          <text>获取诊断报告</text>
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section platform-section">
    <view class="section-row">
      <view>
        <text class="section-eyebrow">AI PLATFORMS</text>
        <text class="section-title">覆盖主流 AI 平台</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="platform-card card">
      <view class="platform-grid">
        <view class="platform-item" wx:for="{{platforms}}" wx:key="key">
          <view class="platform-icon-wrap">
            <image class="platform-logo" src="{{item.icon}}" mode="aspectFit"></image>
          </view>
          <text>{{item.name}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section services-section">
    <text class="section-eyebrow">WHAT GEOGI DOES</text>
    <text class="section-title">199 元诊断报告包含什么</text>
    <text class="section-copy">提交品牌资料并付款后，GeoGi 将完成品牌研究、AI 平台检测、竞品分析与问题诊断，并交付正式报告。</text>

    <view class="service-list">
      <view
        class="service-card card"
        wx:for="{{services}}"
        wx:key="key"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
        bindtap="openService"
      >
        <view class="service-icon-wrap">
          <image src="{{item.icon}}" mode="aspectFit"></image>
        </view>

        <view class="service-copy">
          <text class="service-title">{{item.title}}</text>
          <text class="service-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
        </view>

        <text class="service-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section contact-panel card">
    <text class="contact-eyebrow">NEED HELP?</text>
    <text class="contact-title">先做一次完整 GEO 诊断</text>
    <text class="contact-copy">填写品牌资料后支付 199 元即可开始诊断。处理进度、退款结果和正式报告会同步到「我的」页面。</text>

    <view class="contact-actions">
      <button class="primary-button contact-button" bindtap="goDiagnosis">
        获取诊断报告
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="safe-bottom"></view>
</view>
